      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisa akagamba ati: “MUKAMA agamba ati: Muhurrege ekigambo kya MUKAMA, ijo omu kasumi nka kanu, ekiibo eky'ensaano enungi mali, nimwija kukigura Sekeeri emu, kandi ebiibo bibiri ebya Sairi nimwija kubigura Sekeeri emu ha irembo lya Samaliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyoro omukama ou yaigamiire omukono, yakaguza Erisa ati: “MUKAMA wonyini noobu yakutaire amadirisa omwiguru, ekintu eki kyakubaireho?” Erisa yagarukamu ati: “Ekintu eki, noija kukyerorra n'amaiso gawe, baitu tookiryeho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ihe lya Siriya nirifuruka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha mulyango gw'irembo, hakaba haroho abasaija abagenge bbana, bakakaguzangana bati: “Kiki ekitwikaliize hanu okuhika obu tulikafa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu turaagira tuti; ka tutaahe omu rubuga, orubuga rurumu kiihe, niija kutunagamu; kandi obu turaikara hanu, nabwo okufa titwakutabuke. Habweki nu ekirukukira oburungi, tugende omu rukande rw'Abasiriya; obu baraatugirra embabazi, turaakira obu baraatwita, tufe kihwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwire obu bukaba buli haiha kukwata amaiso, baagenda ha rukande rw'Abasiriya; obu baahikire orukande rw'Abasiriya nambere rurukugarukira batasangeyo muntu n'omu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba MUKAMA, akahuliza ihe ly'Abasiriya emirindi ey'ebigaali n'embaraasi, emirindi ey'ihe erikooto, baateekereza bati: “Omukama wa Isirairi apangisize abakama ab'Abahiiti n'aba Misiri, batuseesire baturwanise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kwiruka obwire nibukwata amaiso, baasiga aho eheema zaabo, embaraasi, enkaina, orukande baaruleka nkooku rukaba ruli, bairuka batabule obwomeezi bwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagenge bali obu baahikire orukande nambere rurukugarukira, baataaha omu heema, baalya baakwata efeeza, zaabbu n'ebyokujwara, baagenda baabisereka; baagaruka baataaha omu heema endijo, baihamu ebintu, nabyo baagenda baabisereka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo baagambirangaine bati: “Eki turukukora tikihikire. Ekiro kinu, nikyo ekiro eky'Amakuru Amarungi; kakuba tuculeera tukalinda okuhika obwire kukya, nitwija kuhikwaho ekifubiro; habweki nu, tugende tugambire abantu ab'omunju y'omukama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baija baayeta abalinzi b'orubuga baabagambira bati: “Tuhikire ha rukande rw'Abasiriya, baitu tituboineyo muntu, tituhuliireyo muntu, tutaboneyo kintu na kimu, okwihaho embaraasi n'enkaina ezisibikirwe, n'eheema, nkooku zikaba ziri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma abalinzi nubwo baayesire abalinzi b'orubuga baabagambira bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akaimuka ekiro yagambira abaheereza be ati: “Ka mbagambire Abasiriya eki bacikire kutukora, bamanyire enjara nkooku etuli kubi, habweki, orukande barurugiremu, baagenda baayesereka omu kisaka nibateekereza ngu, obu turaaruga omu rubuga, nubwo baraatuhamba tuli boomeezi, bahambe n'orubuga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ha baheereza obu yarozire embaraasi ezikaba zisigaireho, nazo nkooku zirukwija kufa nk'enyingi muno ez'Abaisirairi ezikaba zihwerekeriire, yagamba ati: “Ha mbaraasi ezinyakusigaireho, abasaija abamu, batwaleho itaano; tutumeyo turole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baakwata abasaija abatembere embaraasi babiri, omukama yabahondeza ihe ly'Abasiriya, naagamba ati: “Mugende murole.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabahondera okuhika Yorudaani; baasanga omuhanda gwona gwijwire ebyokujwara n'ebintu ebikwatwa eby'omunju, Abasiriya ebi baanagire nibairuka. Abakwenda baagaruka, baagambira omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baaturuka, baanyaga orukande rw'Abasiriya. MUKAMA nkooku yagambire, ekiibo ky'ensaano enungi, kikagurwa sekeeri emu, ebiibo bibiri ebya sairi, nabyo bikagurwa sekeeri emu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akaba akomere omunyoro ou yaigamiire omukono, nuwe alinde irembo, abantu nuho baamurubaatiriire yafa, Erisa nkooku yagambiire omukama obu yamuhikireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba Erisa obu yagambiire omukama ati: “Ebiibo bibiri ebya Sairi nibiija kugurwa sekeeri emu, kandi ekiibo eky'ensaano enungi, ijo kasumi nka kanu omu irembo lya Samaliya, na kyo nikiija kugura sekeeri emu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunyoro akakaguza Erisa ati: “MUKAMA wonyini, kakuba iguru alitamu amadirisa ekintu eki kyakubaireho?” Erisa akagarukamu ati: “Ekintu noija kukirora n'amaiso gawe, baitu tookiryeho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo kyabaire, habwokuba abantu bakamurubatirirra ha irembo, yafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
